# Navis agent contract

Read `AGENTS.md` first. Then use `docs/README.md` to locate subsystem docs and
read `docs/development/agentic-engineering.md` before changing code, tooling, or docs.

Inspect implementation, callers, configuration, and tests before editing. Make
the smallest complete change, update relevant documentation in the same change,
and record material removals in `docs/history/removed-features.md`. Use scoped
rules if present. Run proportionate validation; implementation work requires
`./tool/check.sh`, while runtime-affecting work also requires the app-API and
app-owned screenshot loop in `docs/development/development-workflow.md`.

Never instantiate `NavisDatabase` outside Riverpod, mutate providers during
widget build, break permanent-download → rolling-cache → stream playback
priority, expose credentials, or restore retired Listen Together/Voyage without
an explicit product decision. Review the whole diff and report only validation
actually run.
